    "detailed_description": "<strong>Aliosso is a turn-based roguelike all about combining tiles and cards to win battles and survive a perilous journey across the desert of Samsara.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/1ade99456217220a18ab245a09b56978.poster.avif?t=1755192782\" width=820 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/1ade99456217220a18ab245a09b56978.webm?t=1755192782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Customize your tiles</strong>: place a rune, increase their trigger value, set an edition, or change their type entirely! Find the right cards that synergize with your tiles, and turn that <strong>Power</strong> into devastating strikes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/282ae209d263797718a944346346ca8c.poster.avif?t=1755192782\" width=986 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/282ae209d263797718a944346346ca8c.webm?t=1755192782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/282ae209d263797718a944346346ca8c.mp4?t=1755192782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Cards represent run-altering effects</strong> that can influence just about anything. The rules are malleable, like sand.<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SWAY DESTINY WITH AN OFFERING OF WATER</h2></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/2253e67d0ff8ae913d6f753f45c3e752.poster.avif?t=1755192782\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/2253e67d0ff8ae913d6f753f45c3e752.webm?t=1755192782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/2253e67d0ff8ae913d6f753f45c3e752.mp4?t=1755192782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Prayers affect the battlefield and your run, but require a sacrifice of water</strong>.<br></li><li><strong>Rule-breaking</strong>: banish a card for the entire run or copy a tile onto another \u2014 reshape the rules in your favor.</li></ul><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE JOURNEY</h2></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/41839d01cb1ec48665d13a49250cad68.avif?t=1755192782\" width=800 height=410 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Will you restock on water or look for treasures?<br></li><li>Use canyons, caverns, and other locations to avoid the searing heat of the desert, but beware: no place is without peril.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/c5d150deff07334a7527c1b265cd5719.avif?t=1755192782\" width=600 height=161 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>6 champions</strong> of the desert clans, each with its own run-defining power and tiles.<br></li><li><strong>100+ cards</strong> along with card variants to influence battles and scenarios.<br></li><li><strong>Tens of tiles</strong> to make combos with or to use for their special effect.<br></li><li><strong>Tens of runes</strong> for tile upgrades and extra perks.<br></li><li><strong>Tens of prayers</strong> to use as an escape hatch in difficult situations and to steer the journey in your favor.<br></li><li><strong>Dozens of scenarios</strong> to face.<br></li><li><strong>Different locations</strong> to explore along your journey.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/fae113588fed22cc1a514861a81d86bf.avif?t=1755192782\" width=800 height=129 /></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A DARK DJINN'S RETURN</h2></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/b8005301e793267638fdf29eeb9fcf21.poster.avif?t=1755192782\" width=618 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/b8005301e793267638fdf29eeb9fcf21.webm?t=1755192782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/b8005301e793267638fdf29eeb9fcf21.mp4?t=1755192782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The last surviving human clans endure a nomadic existence fraught with hardship. As generations passed, the history of Samsara faded into oblivion. Long forgotten, <strong>a dark Djinn has found its way back</strong>, driven by an insatiable desire to reclaim its full powers and extend its supreme will on the desert and beyond.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Aliosso is a turn-based roguelike all about combining tiles and cards to win battles and survive a perilous journey across the desert of Samsara.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/1ade99456217220a18ab245a09b56978.poster.avif?t=1755192782\" width=820 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/1ade99456217220a18ab245a09b56978.webm?t=1755192782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Customize your tiles</strong>: place a rune, increase their trigger value, set an edition, or change their type entirely! Find the right cards that synergize with your tiles, and turn that <strong>Power</strong> into devastating strikes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/282ae209d263797718a944346346ca8c.poster.avif?t=1755192782\" width=986 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/282ae209d263797718a944346346ca8c.webm?t=1755192782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/282ae209d263797718a944346346ca8c.mp4?t=1755192782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Cards represent run-altering effects</strong> that can influence just about anything. The rules are malleable, like sand.<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SWAY DESTINY WITH AN OFFERING OF WATER</h2></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730820/extras/2253e67d0ff8ae913d6f753f45c3e752.poster.avif?t=1755192782\" 